{"excerpt_id":"ex_92f5c74d9bda_019","source_id":"src_92f5c74d9bda","source_hash":"7a2ace3411cc8ac0621f5afa64eee6c6c9313ca5095ced3f9457c7c44b3915ff","text":"{\n\"TransactionType\" : \"MPTokenIssuanceSet\" ,\n\"Account\" : \"rNFta7UKwcoiCpxEYbhH2v92numE3cceB6\" ,\n\"MPTokenIssuanceID\" : \"05EECEBE97A7D635DE2393068691A015FED5A89AD203F5AA\" ,\n\"Fee\" : \"10\" ,\n\"Flags\" : 1 ,\n\"Sequence\" : 99536577\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 231","char_start":4974,"char_end":5197,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:38:00.852Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_92f5c74d9bda_020","source_id":"src_92f5c74d9bda","source_hash":"7a2ace3411cc8ac0621f5afa64eee6c6c9313ca5095ced3f9457c7c44b3915ff","text":"In addition to the common fields , MPTokenIssuanceSet transactions use the following fields:","location_hint":"paragraph 234","char_start":5253,"char_end":5345,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:38:00.852Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_92f5c74d9bda_021","source_id":"src_92f5c74d9bda","source_hash":"7a2ace3411cc8ac0621f5afa64eee6c6c9313ca5095ced3f9457c7c44b3915ff","text":"Field JSON Type Internal Type Required? Description","location_hint":"paragraph 235","char_start":5349,"char_end":5400,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:38:00.852Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_92f5c74d9bda_022","source_id":"src_92f5c74d9bda","source_hash":"7a2ace3411cc8ac0621f5afa64eee6c6c9313ca5095ced3f9457c7c44b3915ff","text":"DomainID String - Hash UInt256 No The ledger entry ID of a permissioned domain that grants access to the MPT. An empty value or 0 removes the permissioned domain from the MPT issuance so that only users who are explicitly approved by the issuer can send and receive the MPT. You can only set a DomainID if the MPT issuance has Require Auth enabled.","location_hint":"paragraph 236","char_start":5404,"char_end":5752,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:38:00.852Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_92f5c74d9bda_023","source_id":"src_92f5c74d9bda","source_hash":"7a2ace3411cc8ac0621f5afa64eee6c6c9313ca5095ced3f9457c7c44b3915ff","text":"Requires the PermissionedDomains amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 237","char_start":5754,"char_end":5809,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:38:00.852Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_92f5c74d9bda_024","source_id":"src_92f5c74d9bda","source_hash":"7a2ace3411cc8ac0621f5afa64eee6c6c9313ca5095ced3f9457c7c44b3915ff","text":"Requires the SingleAssetVault amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 238","char_start":5813,"char_end":5865,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:38:00.852Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_92f5c74d9bda_025","source_id":"src_92f5c74d9bda","source_hash":"7a2ace3411cc8ac0621f5afa64eee6c6c9313ca5095ced3f9457c7c44b3915ff","text":"MPTokenIssuanceID String - Hexadecimal UInt192 Yes The identifier of the MPTokenIssuance to update.","location_hint":"paragraph 239","char_start":5869,"char_end":5968,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:38:00.852Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_92f5c74d9bda_026","source_id":"src_92f5c74d9bda","source_hash":"7a2ace3411cc8ac0621f5afa64eee6c6c9313ca5095ced3f9457c7c44b3915ff","text":"Holder String - Address AccountID No An individual token holder. If provided, apply changes to the given holder&#x27;s balance of the given MPT issuance. If omitted, apply to all accounts holding the given MPT issuance.","location_hint":"paragraph 240","char_start":5970,"char_end":6189,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:38:00.852Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_92f5c74d9bda_027","source_id":"src_92f5c74d9bda","source_hash":"7a2ace3411cc8ac0621f5afa64eee6c6c9313ca5095ced3f9457c7c44b3915ff","text":"Transactions of the MPTokenIssuanceSet type support additional values in the Flags field, as follows:","location_hint":"paragraph 242","char_start":6219,"char_end":6320,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:38:00.852Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_92f5c74d9bda_028","source_id":"src_92f5c74d9bda","source_hash":"7a2ace3411cc8ac0621f5afa64eee6c6c9313ca5095ced3f9457c7c44b3915ff","text":"Flag Name Hex Value Decimal Value Description","location_hint":"paragraph 243","char_start":6324,"char_end":6369,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:38:00.852Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_92f5c74d9bda_029","source_id":"src_92f5c74d9bda","source_hash":"7a2ace3411cc8ac0621f5afa64eee6c6c9313ca5095ced3f9457c7c44b3915ff","text":"tfMPTLock 0x00000001 1 Enable to lock balances of this MPT issuance.","location_hint":"paragraph 244","char_start":6373,"char_end":6441,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:38:00.852Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_92f5c74d9bda_030","source_id":"src_92f5c74d9bda","source_hash":"7a2ace3411cc8ac0621f5afa64eee6c6c9313ca5095ced3f9457c7c44b3915ff","text":"tfMPTUnlock 0x00000002 2 Enable to unlock balances of this MPT issuance.","location_hint":"paragraph 245","char_start":6443,"char_end":6515,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:38:00.852Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_92f5c74d9bda_031","source_id":"src_92f5c74d9bda","source_hash":"7a2ace3411cc8ac0621f5afa64eee6c6c9313ca5095ced3f9457c7c44b3915ff","text":"Besides errors that can occur for all transactions, MPTokenIssuanceSet transactions can result in the following transaction result codes :","location_hint":"paragraph 247","char_start":6532,"char_end":6670,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:38:00.852Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_92f5c74d9bda_032","source_id":"src_92f5c74d9bda","source_hash":"7a2ace3411cc8ac0621f5afa64eee6c6c9313ca5095ced3f9457c7c44b3915ff","text":"temDISABLED The MPTokensV1 amendment is disabled. You will also receive this error if you include a DomainID field in the transaction, but the PermissionedDomains and SingleAssetVault amendments are both disabled.","location_hint":"paragraph 249","char_start":6700,"char_end":6913,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:38:00.852Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_92f5c74d9bda_033","source_id":"src_92f5c74d9bda","source_hash":"7a2ace3411cc8ac0621f5afa64eee6c6c9313ca5095ced3f9457c7c44b3915ff","text":"tecNO_DST The account specified in the Holder field doesn&#x27;t exist.","location_hint":"paragraph 250","char_start":6915,"char_end":6986,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:38:00.852Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_92f5c74d9bda_034","source_id":"src_92f5c74d9bda","source_hash":"7a2ace3411cc8ac0621f5afa64eee6c6c9313ca5095ced3f9457c7c44b3915ff","text":"tecNO_PERMISSION - The lsfMPTCanLock flag isn&#x27;t enabled, but you are attempting to lock or unlock an MPT.\n- The SingleAssetVault amendment is disabled and you&#x27;re trying to modify a DomainID field.","location_hint":"paragraph 251","char_start":6988,"char_end":7194,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:38:00.852Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_92f5c74d9bda_035","source_id":"src_92f5c74d9bda","source_hash":"7a2ace3411cc8ac0621f5afa64eee6c6c9313ca5095ced3f9457c7c44b3915ff","text":"temMALFORMED Besides generally malformed transactions, you can receive this error if:\n- You specified a DomainID and Holder value; only one can be set in a single transaction.\n- You specified the same account for both Account and Holder .\n- The transaction isn&#x27;t changing anything; it must either update a flag or modify the DomainID .","location_hint":"paragraph 252","char_start":7196,"char_end":7536,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:38:00.852Z"}
